@database tools.guide
@$VER: tools.guide 1.0 (29.9.2026)

@node Main "ZZ9000 command-line tools"
The installer puts the diagnostic and maintenance tools in @{b}C:@{ub}, where any
shell finds them. This manual covers the firmware updater, the networking
tools, the board diagnostic, and the scanline controller; @{b}ZZCapture@{ub} has its
own manual (@{b}ZZCapture.guide@{ub} in this drawer), and the GUI tools ZZTop and
ZZPlay install to @{b}SYS:Utilities/ZZ9000/@{ub}.

Contents

@{"Firmware updates - ZZFwUpdate" link firmware-updates-zzfwupdate}

@{"Backups and rollback" link backups-and-rollback}

@{"Networking - ZZ9000Net.device" link networking-zz9000net-device}

@{"ZZNetStats" link zznetstats}

@{"Board diagnostics - ZZDiag" link board-diagnostics-zzdiag}

